## 5. EVENT SOURCING FOR CROATIAN MARKETS

### 5.1 Reliable Data Sources

| Source | Type | Coverage | Reliability |
|---|---|---|---|
| HRT News RSS | RSS feed | Croatian news | Official state media |
| Jutarnji/Večernji/Index.hr | Web scrape (risky) | Wider news | Copyright concerns |
| Sabor.hr | Official API/HTML | Parliament votes | Government source |
| DZS (Croatian Bureau of Statistics) | API | Economic data | Official |
| SofaScore API | Already integrated | HNL football | Already working |
| HNB (Croatian National Bank) | API | Exchange rates | Official |
| Eurovision official | API | Event calendar | Official |
| Google Trends | API | Trending topics | Indicates interest |

### 5.2 Event Ingestion Pipeline

```
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────┐
│ Source APIs   │────▶│ Fetcher      │────▶│ Suggestion   │────▶│ Admin    │
│ RSS / Scrape  │     │ (Cron Job)   │     │ Queue (DB)   │     │ Approval │
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └────┬─────┘
                                                                     │
                                                              ┌──────▼──────┐
                                                              │ Market      │
                                                              │ Created     │
                                                              │ + Liquidity │
                                                              └─────────────┘
```

### 5.3 Database Model for Suggestions

```prisma
model MarketSuggestion {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  source       String                    // "hrt_rss", "manual", "sofascore"
  sourceUrl    String?
  title        String
  titleEn      String?
  description  String   @db.Text
  categorySlug String
  endDate      DateTime?
  status       String   @default("pending") // pending, approved, rejected
  reviewedBy   String?                      // admin userId
  reviewedAt   DateTime?
  marketId     String?                      // linked market if approved
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([status, createdAt])
}
```

### 5.4 Fetcher Implementation (Cron Job)

```typescript
// src/app/api/cron/fetch-events/route.ts
// Vercel Cron: runs every 6 hours

export async function GET(req: NextRequest) {
  // Verify cron secret
  if (req.headers.get("Authorization") !== `Bearer ${process.env.CRON_SECRET}`) {
    return NextResponse.json({ error: "Unauthorized" }, { status: 401 });
  }

  // 1. Fetch HRT RSS
  const hrtItems = await fetchHrtRss();

  // 2. Use Groq LLM to generate market suggestions from news
  const suggestions = await generateMarketSuggestions(hrtItems);

  // 3. Insert into MarketSuggestion table
  for (const s of suggestions) {
    await prisma.marketSuggestion.create({ data: s });
  }

  return NextResponse.json({ created: suggestions.length });
}
```

### 5.5 Anti-Hallucination Safeguards

1. LLM generates suggestions, but NEVER auto-creates markets
2. Every suggestion requires human admin approval
3. LLM prompt includes: "Only suggest markets for events that are verifiable and have a clear resolution date. Do not invent events."
4. Include source URL in every suggestion
5. Admin UI shows the source article alongside the suggestion for verification

